# core/data/talk/grammar/en/cool_tease.tlk - more replies to CRITICIZE and TEASE (owner: TK;
# T5b package T5B-COOL). Friendly needling and thin skin, clean in any room. Nothing here
# aims at a body, a family or a loss. No register word. Syntax: core/tools/talkc_gen.py.

# ---- CRITICIZE -> DISAGREE ---------------------------------------------------------------------
@rule core.criticize.c_disagree act: disagree
  "Wrong. It's not bad, it's avant-garde. Look it up."
  "I'm sorry, did I ask for notes? I did not. Thanks anyway."
  "You've got it backwards. It's meant to look like that."
  "Nope. I did that on purpose. Every crooked inch of it."
  "That's your opinion. Mine's better, it has glitter."
  "It's perfect. You just don't have the eyes for it."
  "Excuse me? I worked very hard on that. For nearly a minute."
  "Strong words from someone who can't fold a towel."
  "I think you'll find it's a design choice. Please hold your applause."
  "Funny, the last critic said that. Then they got a hat."
@rule core.criticize.c_disagree_blunt guard: blunt&!kid_present act: disagree
  "You're wrong. And I'm too busy to explain why. Bye."
  "No. You just have no taste. It's okay, it's genetic."
  "Cool opinion. Wrong, but cool. Keep it in your pocket."
@rule core.criticize.c_disagree_loud guard: loud act: disagree
  "NO, IT'S GOOD! IT'S EXCELLENT! YOU'RE LOOKING AT IT WRONG!"
  "HOW DARE YOU! THAT'S A MASTERPIECE! ASK ANYONE, ASK THE DUCK!"
@rule core.criticize.c_disagree_polite guard: polite act: disagree
  "I appreciate the feedback, but I respectfully disagree. Very, very much."
  "That's one view, and I thank you. I'll be ignoring it."
  "How kind of you to say. I must beg to differ, dear."
@rule core.criticize.c_disagree_quirky guard: quirky act: disagree
  "That's what the moon said, and look how that turned out."
  "Nuh-uh! It's art! It's a sandwich of feelings!"
  "The spoon told me it was fine. The spoon never lies."
@rule core.criticize.c_disagree_serious guard: serious act: disagree
  "I have reviewed it three times. It stands. Next."
  "Your criticism is noted and found wanting. Please try again."
@rule core.criticize.c_disagree_elder guard: elder act: disagree
  "Young person, I've been doing it this way since before you hatched."
  "Pfft. It's served me forty years. It'll serve you longer."
@rule core.criticize.c_disagree_kid guard: kid_speaker tags: kid act: disagree
  "Nuh-uh, it's good! I made it myself! With glue!"
  "You're wrong! It's the best one! Ask my friends!"
@rule core.criticize.c_disagree_x guard: topic act: disagree
  "Leave {x} out of it! {x:cap} is great. You're just jealous."
  "{x:cap} is fine. It's you that needs fixing. Gently."

# ---- CRITICIZE -> AGREE / APOLOGIZE -----------------------------------------------------------
@rule core.criticize.c_agree act: agree
  "Yeah, you're right. I'd say I'll fix it, but I won't."
  "Okay, fair, it's pretty bad. I like it anyway."
  "True, true. It's been wobbly since I got it. Like me."
  "Ugh, you noticed. I was hoping nobody would. Stop looking."
  "Yep. It's a mess. A beautiful, tragic mess."
  "You're not wrong. Don't tell anyone. I've a reputation."
  "Honestly? I've thought the same. It's good to hear it out loud."
  "That's the nicest rude thing anyone's said all week."
@rule core.criticize.c_agree_easy guard: easygoing act: agree
  "Yeah, probably. I'll get to it, maybe. When the moon's right."
  "Ha, true, oh well. Perfect's overrated. It's boring."
@rule core.criticize.c_agree_flat guard: flat act: agree
  "Correct. {.}I'll cry about it later. Put it in my diary."
  "Yes, it's bad. I'm feeling something, I think. Maybe."
@rule core.criticize.c_agree_sad guard: mood=sad act: agree
  "You're right. I'm not great at anything. Except naps."
  "Yeah, I know. Thanks for saying it out loud. It's honest."
@rule core.criticize.c_agree_kid guard: kid_speaker tags: kid act: agree
  "Aw, you're right. It's a bit wonky. Can you help me fix it?"
  "Yeah, I messed up. I'll try again! Third time's the charm!"
@rule core.criticize.c_apologize act: apologize
  "Sorry, sorry! You're right. I'll try to be less me."
  "Oops, okay. I'll do better. Tomorrow, probably."
  "My bad! I get a bit carried away. It's a family curse."
  "Oh dear. That's my fault. I'll be less terrible, promise."
  "You're right and I'm sorry. I'll buy you a biscuit. A small one."
  "I'm sorry. I'll give it another go. A smaller, quieter go."
@rule core.criticize.c_apologize_polite guard: polite act: apologize
  "I do apologise. I was rather careless, wasn't I? How embarrassing."
  "You're quite right, and I'm mortified. Do forgive me."
  "Terribly sorry. It won't happen again. At least not this week."
@rule core.criticize.c_apologize_kid guard: kid_speaker tags: kid act: apologize
  "Sorry, I didn't mean it. Don't be mad, please? Pretty please?"
  "I'm sorry, I'll fix it! Don't tell! Okay, tell, but nicely."

# ---- CRITICIZE -> COMPLAIN / DISMISS / JOKE ------------------------------------------------------
@rule core.criticize.c_complain act: complain
  "Everyone's a critic these days. Where's the encouragement?"
  "I try my best and this is the thanks I get. A sigh."
  "Wow, rude. I put in all the effort I had. All three units."
  "I'm doing my best! My best is just a bit... imaginative."
  "That's so unfair. I need a lie-down. And a medal."
  "Could you be nicer? Just a little? I'm made of glass."
  "Thanks for that. I'll have it engraved on my tombstone. Eventually."
@rule core.criticize.c_complain_sad guard: mood=sad act: complain
  "That hurts a bit. Today of all days. I was doing okay."
  "I'm trying. I really am. It's just hard sometimes."
@rule core.criticize.c_complain_angry guard: mood=angry act: complain
  "Oh, great. Now I'm even crosser. You're feeding the beast."
  "Do NOT critique me today. I'll bite. Gently, but I will."
@rule core.criticize.c_dismiss act: dismiss
  "Mm. Thanks for your input. It's been logged in the trash."
  "Cool critique. Now, about my lunch."
  "Opinions are like noses. Everyone has one, most of them run."
  "I'll consider it. {.}I've considered it. No."
  "Take it up with my manager. He's a coat rack."
  "You've missed your window for notes. It closed at birth."
@rule core.criticize.c_dismiss_blunt guard: blunt&!kid_present act: dismiss
  "Nobody asked. Move along, nothing to see, especially you."
  "Did you want a medal for that insight? Because I'm fresh out."
@rule core.criticize.c_joke act: joke
  "I take notes the way a sieve takes soup. With love and zero results."
  "You should see my other mistakes. They're in a museum."
  "That's my best feature, honestly. The flaws. They're load-bearing."
  "I'll add it to my list. It's number 4,096. Right below breathing."
  "Critique accepted. Now let's go and be wrong together."

# ---- TEASE -> TEASE -------------------------------------------------------------------------------
@rule core.tease.c_back act: tease
  "Oh, you're asking for it now. I'll tease you till you squeak."
  "Hah! Look who's got jokes. Did you save them up all week?"
  "You know what you look like? Someone who's about to be teased."
  "Careful! I've got a fresh stock of insults. Aged in barrels."
  "Teasing me? Bold and brave, and slightly foolish. I like it."
  "Aw, you're sweet. Like a lemon dipped in confidence."
  "That's the best you've got? Wow. I'll teach you someday."
  "Okay, you've started it. Now I'll finish it, with a bow."
  "Your jokes are like your hair. They go all over the place."
  "You're adorable when you're brave. Like a kitten in a tie."
@rule core.tease.c_back_quirky guard: quirky act: tease
  "Teasing me is like poking a pudding. It jiggles back."
  "Tee-hee! I tease you backwards! Esuoh ruoy fo eno era uoy!"
  "You've got a nice mismatched aura. Like a sock drawer."
@rule core.tease.c_back_loud guard: loud act: tease
  "OH YOU'RE ON, TEASE-OFF! LOSER BUYS PIE, READY? GO!"
  "HA! YOU TEASE LIKE A FEATHER! COME ON, GIVE ME THE ELBOW!"
@rule core.tease.c_back_rival guard: rel=rival act: tease
  "Still tickling? I'd call it cute, but I'm trying not to like you."
  "Oh, I tease YOU? Make a note: I'm winning. Always."
@rule core.tease.c_back_friend guard: rel=friend act: tease
  "Teasing me? I thought we were best friends. {.}Okay, we are."
  "My favourite pest. Carry on. I'll heckle back in a bit."
@rule core.tease.c_back_polite guard: polite act: tease
  "Oh, you cheeky thing. I'll let it pass. This once."
  "How naughty! I'll pretend I didn't hear. And store it for later."
@rule core.tease.c_back_elder guard: elder act: tease
  "Ha! I've teased better than you before breakfast, dear."
  "Don't sass your elders. Or do. I'll sass right back, faster."
@rule core.tease.c_back_flat guard: flat act: tease
  "Teasing. {.}I'm laughing on the inside. It's a small room."
  "Ha. {.}That was a laugh. In my head, I fell off a chair."
@rule core.tease.c_back_kid guard: kid_speaker tags: kid act: tease
  "You're silly! You're sillier than a goat! In a hat!"
  "Stop it, you're funny! I'm not laughing! I'm totally laughing!"
  "Hee! You're a big goof. A bigger goof than me!"

# ---- TEASE -> LAUGH / JOKE / DISMISS / COMPLAIN / AGREE ------------------------------------------
@rule core.tease.c_laugh act: laugh
  "Pfft! Okay, that got me. I'll allow it, you little menace."
  "Ha! Fair play, fair play. You're funnier than you look."
  "Hee hee! Stop, you'll make me snort. Too late, snort."
  "Hah, cheeky. I like cheeky. Cheeky's the new tidy."
  "Oh, that's good! I'm stealing it. I'll say it in the pub."
  "I'm laughing, but I'm also plotting revenge. Both things."
  "Heh, okay. Teasing accepted. Please deliver more in writing."
@rule core.tease.c_laugh_loud guard: loud act: laugh
  "HA HA HA! OH, THAT'S GOOD! I'M GONNA FALL OFF MY CHAIR!"
  "BWAHAHA! YOU'RE A DEMON! A HILARIOUS ONE!"
@rule core.tease.c_joke act: joke
  "I know! I'm a riot. A small, polite riot, with snacks."
  "Oh, I'm not teased. I'm the teased. It's my job."
  "Yes, yes, I'm a delight and a disgrace. The full set."
  "You want teasing? Wait till you see my dancing. It's a crime."
  "That's rich, from someone whose hat has a hat."
@rule core.tease.c_dismiss act: dismiss
  "Tease away. I've got thick skin and thin patience. Mostly thick."
  "Uh-huh. I'll be over there, ignoring you in a dignified way."
  "That wasn't teasing. That was a mild breeze. Do better."
  "Sure. Anyway, you were saying something less boring?"
  "It takes effort to tease me. You haven't made the effort."
@rule core.tease.c_complain act: complain
  "Stop picking on me! I'm a delicate flower. A cranky one."
  "Hey! It's not nice to poke fun. It's nice to poke cake."
  "You're so mean today! Mean as a wasp in a sock."
  "Ugh, why do you always do this? It's like a hobby."
  "Not cool! I'm touchy about it. Very touchy, like a cat."
@rule core.tease.c_complain_sad guard: mood=sad act: complain
  "Not today, please. I'm a bit fragile. Like a pretzel."
  "I'm not in the mood. Be gentle? Just this once."
@rule core.tease.c_agree act: agree
  "Yeah, okay, it's true. I'm like that. It's a whole thing."
  "Ha, you got me. I'm exactly that. Down to the socks."
  "Guilty. I'll plead guilty and ask for a biscuit."
  "You're not wrong. That's the scary part. You know me."
  "Okay, okay, spot on. I'm owning it. Applaud now."
